From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211: look up the AP station by the AP MLD address

A station interface stores the station of its AP under
vif.cfg.ap_addr, which holds the BSSID for a non-MLO association and the
AP MLD address for an MLO one. Three lookups use
sdata->deflink.u.mgd.bssid instead. ieee80211_vif_update_links() uses
the default link if and only if the interface has no valid links, so an
MLO association writes the BSSID into separate link data, and
sdata->deflink.u.mgd.bssid stays at the zero address.

For an MLO association, these lookups find no station:

- the 4-address change in ieee80211_change_iface(), which then never
  tells the driver to enable 4-address mode;
- ieee80211_netdev_fill_forward_path(), which then reports no path and
  silently disables hardware flow offload;
- ieee80211_get_stats(), which then falls back to survey only
  statistics.

Look up the station by vif.cfg.ap_addr, which is correct in both cases.

Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/net/mac80211/cfg.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/cfg.c
@@ -285,7 +285,7 @@ static int ieee80211_change_iface(struct
 		if (!ifmgd->associated)
 			return 0;
 
-		sta = sta_info_get(sdata, sdata->deflink.u.mgd.bssid);
+		sta = sta_info_get(sdata, sdata->vif.cfg.ap_addr);
 		if (sta)
 			drv_sta_set_4addr(local, sdata, &sta->sta,
 					  params->use_4addr);
--- a/net/mac80211/ethtool.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/ethtool.c
@@ -109,7 +109,7 @@ static void ieee80211_get_stats(struct n
 	guard(wiphy)(local->hw.wiphy);
 
 	if (sdata->vif.type == NL80211_IFTYPE_STATION) {
-		sta = sta_info_get_bss(sdata, sdata->deflink.u.mgd.bssid);
+		sta = sta_info_get_bss(sdata, sdata->vif.cfg.ap_addr);
 
 		if (!(sta && !WARN_ON(sta->sdata->dev != dev)))
 			goto do_survey;
--- a/net/mac80211/iface.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/iface.c
@@ -1035,7 +1035,7 @@ static int ieee80211_netdev_fill_forward
 			}
 		}
 
-		sta = sta_info_get(sdata, sdata->deflink.u.mgd.bssid);
+		sta = sta_info_get(sdata, sdata->vif.cfg.ap_addr);
 		break;
 	default:
 		goto out;
